   1            
   2            / The instructions say the tape must be positioned on
   3            / the first non-zero byte.  I have adjusted the DCA
   4            / accordingly.
   5            / Press Start, turn the tape on, then press Continue 4
   6            / times.  When the reader stops, the computer may be
   7            / started at 07600 to clear memory, or the BIN or RIM
   8            / loaders may be used.
   9            
  10                    *0030
  11 00030 7402 START,  HLT             / Misdocumented as OSR
  12 00031 6036         KRB             / Read character 0000abcdefgh
  13 00032 7012         RTR             / g hL0000abcdef
  14 00033 7010         RAR             / f ghL0000abcde
  15 00034 3027         DCA 0027        / Store an instruction
  16 00035 2034         ISZ .-1         / Store next after, use f as L
  17 00036 5030         JMP START       / Go again
  18            *START  / Starting address
  19            $
